    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<p class="" data-start="342" data-end="578"><a href="/zh-tw/product/milk-thistle-seed-bulk-north-china-production/"><strong data-start="342" data-end="358">水飛薊</strong></a> (Silybum Marianum) 聽起來可能像童話故事裡的東西, 但這是現實世界的超級英雄——尤其是在肝臟健康方面. 它經常被宣傳為天然的肝臟解毒劑, 但很多人仍然想知道:</p><p class="" data-start="342" data-end="578"><strong>什麼時候去牛奶薊早晨或晚上?</strong></p><p class="" data-start="649" data-end="860">要正確回答這個問題, 我們將一步步分解──水飛薊裡面有什麼, 它是如何運作的, 您的身體在一天中的不同時間如何運作, 潛在的副作用, 以及如何獲得最佳效果.</p><hr class="" data-start="862" data-end="865" /><div id="ez-toc-container" class="ez-toc-v2_0_85 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction"><div class="ez-toc-title-container"><p class="ez-toc-title" style="cursor:inherit">目錄</p>
<span class="ez-toc-title-toggle"><a href="#" class="ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Table of Content"><span class="ez-toc-js-icon-con"><span class=""><span class="eztoc-hide" style="display:none;">切換</span><span class="ez-toc-icon-toggle-span"><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="list-377408" width="20px" height="20px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" class="arrow-unsorted-368013" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10px" height="10px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.2" baseProfile="tiny"><path d="M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1" href="#1_Whats_in_Milk_Thistle_and_How_Does_It_Work" >1. 水飛薊有什麼成分, 以及它是如何運作的?</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2" href="#How_does_it_work" >它是如何運作的?</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3" href="#2_Morning_vs_Night_Understanding_Your_Bodys_Internal_Clock" >2. 早上 vs. 夜晚: 了解身體的內在時鐘</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#Morning_6_AM_%E2%80%93_10_AM" >早晨 (6 是 - 10 是)</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#Night_8_PM_%E2%80%93_2_AM" >夜晚 (8 下午 – 2 是)</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#3_Morning_vs_Night_Which_Is_Better_for_Milk_Thistle" >3. 早上 vs. 夜晚: 水飛薊哪個比較好?</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#Best_choice_After_dinner_before_bedtime" >最佳選擇: 晚餐後, 睡前</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#When_morning_might_be_better" >早晨什麼時候會更好:</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#4_Potential_Side_Effects_and_Safety_Tips" >4. 潛在的副作用和安全提示</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#Reported_side_effects_from_Mayo_Clinic_and_WebMD" >報告的副作用 (來自梅奧診所和 WebMD):</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11" href="#Safety_guidelines" >安全指南:</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#5_How_to_Take_Milk_Thistle_for_Best_Results_Pair_It_Smartly" >5. 如何服用水飛薊以獲得最佳效果: 巧妙配對</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#Best_pairings" >最佳配對:</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-14" href="#Sample_routine" >範例程式:</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-15" href="#6_Final_Verdict_Morning_or_Night" >6. 最終判決: 早上或晚上?</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-16" href="#References" >參考</a></li></ul></li></ul></nav></div><h2 class="" data-start="867" data-end="918"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_Whats_in_Milk_Thistle_and_How_Does_It_Work"></span>1. 水飛薊有什麼成分, 以及它是如何運作的?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="920" data-end="1041">水飛薊的關鍵活性成分是一種稱為 <strong data-start="989" data-end="1002">甲矽林</strong>, 含有多種生物類黃酮:</p><ul data-start="1043" data-end="1107"><li class="" data-start="1043" data-end="1071"><p class="" data-start="1045" data-end="1071"><strong data-start="1045" data-end="1056">水飛薊賓</strong> (約 50–70%)</p></li><li class="" data-start="1072" data-end="1088"><p class="" data-start="1074" data-end="1088"><strong data-start="1074" data-end="1088">水飛薊寧</strong></p></li><li class="" data-start="1089" data-end="1107"><p class="" data-start="1091" data-end="1107"><strong data-start="1091" data-end="1107">水飛薊亭</strong></p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="1109" data-end="1294"><p class="" data-start="1111" data-end="1294">將水飛薊素視為工具箱: 水飛薊賓是扳手, 螺絲起子中的水飛薊, 和鉗子水飛薊汀. 每個人都有一個角色, 但它們共同幫助修復和保護您的肝臟.</p></blockquote><h3 class="" data-start="1296" data-end="1317"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_does_it_work"></span>它是如何運作的?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ol data-start="1319" data-end="1932"><li class="" data-start="1319" data-end="1468"><p class="" data-start="1322" data-end="1468"><strong data-start="1322" data-end="1343">抗氧化能力</strong><br data-start="1343" data-end="1346" />水飛薊素可中和自由基並減少氧化應激, 就像給你的肝細胞塗上防銹塗層一樣.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1470" data-end="1590"><p class="" data-start="1473" data-end="1590"><strong data-start="1473" data-end="1502">抗發炎作用</strong><br data-start="1502" data-end="1505" />它可以減少肝臟組織的炎症, 平息過度活躍的免疫反應.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1592" data-end="1735"><p class="" data-start="1595" data-end="1735"><strong data-start="1595" data-end="1622">肝細胞再生</strong><br data-start="1622" data-end="1625" />它有助於刺激蛋白質合成, 促進肝細胞再生－就像為電池充電一樣.</p></li><li class="" data-start="1737" data-end="1932"><p class="" data-start="1740" data-end="1932"><strong data-start="1740" data-end="1768">細胞膜保護</strong><br data-start="1768" data-end="1771" />水飛薊素增強肝細胞膜, 阻止酒精或藥物等毒素進入, 在俱樂部的 VIP 區扮演保鑣的角色 (你的肝臟).</p></li></ol><blockquote data-start="1934" data-end="2154"><p class="" data-start="1936" data-end="2154"><em data-start="1939" data-end="2120">臨床研究表明 420 水飛薊素毫克/天 (通常分為三劑 140 毫克) 顯著改善酒精性肝炎和脂肪肝患者的標記物</em> (來源: 考研, PMID: 12143008).</p></blockquote><hr class="" data-start="2156" data-end="2159" /><h2 class="" data-start="2161" data-end="2226"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_Morning_vs_Night_Understanding_Your_Bodys_Internal_Clock"></span>2. 早上 vs. 夜晚: 了解身體的內在時鐘<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="2228" data-end="2370">您的身體按照晝夜節律運行, 就像自然的 24 小時時間表一樣，控制著從睡眠到消化再到荷爾蒙水平的一切.</p><h3 class="" data-start="2372" data-end="2398"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Morning_6_AM_%E2%80%93_10_AM"></span>早晨 (6 是 - 10 是)<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="2400" data-end="2575"><li class="" data-start="2400" data-end="2428"><p class="" data-start="2402" data-end="2428">肝臟代謝較慢</p></li><li class="" data-start="2429" data-end="2493"><p class="" data-start="2431" data-end="2493">皮質醇 (壓力荷爾蒙) 高峰—您的身體為新的一天做好準備</p></li><li class="" data-start="2494" data-end="2575"><p class="" data-start="2496" data-end="2575">消化酵素開始升高, 但營養吸收還沒達到高峰</p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="2577" data-end="2680"><p class="" data-start="2579" data-end="2680"><em data-start="2582" data-end="2680">把你的身體想像成一台早上啟動的電腦——它已經開啟, 但還沒有全速.</em></p></blockquote><h3 class="" data-start="2682" data-end="2705"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Night_8_PM_%E2%80%93_2_AM"></span>夜晚 (8 下午 – 2 是)<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="2707" data-end="2864"><li class="" data-start="2707" data-end="2760"><p class="" data-start="2709" data-end="2760">肝臟修復和排毒全面啟動</p></li><li class="" data-start="2761" data-end="2809"><p class="" data-start="2763" data-end="2809">睡眠觸發全身細胞修復</p></li><li class="" data-start="2810" data-end="2864"><p class="" data-start="2812" data-end="2864">消化減慢, 但身體會轉入治癒模式</p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="2866" data-end="2962"><p class="" data-start="2868" data-end="2962"><em data-start="2871" data-end="2962">晚上, 您的身體進入“維護模式”——就像手機在睡覺時更新應用程式一樣.</em></p></blockquote><hr class="" data-start="2964" data-end="2967" /><h2 class="" data-start="2969" data-end="3027"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Morning_vs_Night_Which_Is_Better_for_Milk_Thistle"></span>3. 早上 vs. 夜晚: 水飛薊哪個比較好?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 class="" data-start="3029" data-end="3080"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Best_choice_After_dinner_before_bedtime"></span>最佳選擇: <strong data-start="3048" data-end="3080">晚餐後, 睡前</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p class="" data-start="3082" data-end="3086">為什麼?</p><ul data-start="3088" data-end="3273"><li class="" data-start="3088" data-end="3145"><p class="" data-start="3090" data-end="3145">肝臟的排毒和再生在夜間最活躍</p></li><li class="" data-start="3146" data-end="3216"><p class="" data-start="3148" data-end="3216">新陳代謝較慢意味著補充劑在您的系統中停留的時間更長</p></li><li class="" data-start="3217" data-end="3273"><p class="" data-start="3219" data-end="3273">您可以在身體的自然修復窗口期為身體提供支持</p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="3275" data-end="3326"><p class="" data-start="3277" data-end="3326"><strong data-start="3277" data-end="3299">最佳服用時間:</strong> 30– 晚餐後 60 分鐘</p></blockquote><h3 class="" data-start="3328" data-end="3364"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="When_morning_might_be_better"></span>早晨什麼時候會更好:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="3366" data-end="3519"><li class="" data-start="3366" data-end="3462"><p class="" data-start="3368" data-end="3462">如果您白天正在服用藥物或飲酒並且想要 <em data-start="3443" data-end="3462">保護緩衝液</em></p></li><li class="" data-start="3463" data-end="3519"><p class="" data-start="3465" data-end="3519">如果夜間出現腸胃不適</p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="3521" data-end="3598"><p class="" data-start="3523" data-end="3598"><strong data-start="3523" data-end="3546">替代時間:</strong> 早餐後服用 (永遠不要空腹)</p></blockquote><hr class="" data-start="3600" data-end="3603" /><h2 class="" data-start="3605" data-end="3649"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_Potential_Side_Effects_and_Safety_Tips"></span>4. 潛在的副作用和安全提示<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="3651" data-end="3723">雖然總體上是安全的, 奶薊草並非完全沒有副作用.</p><h3 class="" data-start="3725" data-end="3780"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Reported_side_effects_from_Mayo_Clinic_and_WebMD"></span>報告的副作用 (來自梅奧診所和 WebMD):<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="3782" data-end="4014"><li class="" data-start="3782" data-end="3824"><p class="" data-start="3784" data-end="3824">輕度腹瀉或腹脹 (約 5% 的用戶)</p></li><li class="" data-start="3825" data-end="3933"><p class="" data-start="3827" data-end="3933">過敏反應－尤其是對豚草過敏的人, 雛菊, 或其他 <strong data-start="3905" data-end="3919">菊科</strong> 家庭植物</p></li><li class="" data-start="3934" data-end="4014"><p class="" data-start="3936" data-end="4014">可能會幹擾肝臟處理藥物的能力 (CYP450途徑)</p></li></ul><p class="" data-start="4016" data-end="4049"><strong data-start="4016" data-end="4049">需要注意的藥物:</strong></p><ul data-start="4051" data-end="4123"><li class="" data-start="4051" data-end="4060"><p class="" data-start="4053" data-end="4060">他汀類藥物</p></li><li class="" data-start="4061" data-end="4078"><p class="" data-start="4063" data-end="4078">抗憂鬱藥</p></li><li class="" data-start="4079" data-end="4123"><p class="" data-start="4081" data-end="4123">荷爾蒙藥物 (例如。, 計劃生育)</p></li></ul><h3 class="" data-start="4125" data-end="4147"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Safety_guidelines"></span>安全指南:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="4149" data-end="4343"><li class="" data-start="4149" data-end="4202"><p class="" data-start="4151" data-end="4202">不建議在懷孕或哺乳期間使用</p></li><li class="" data-start="4203" data-end="4282"><p class="" data-start="4205" data-end="4282">除非醫生建議，否則避免與高劑量肝毒性藥物一起使用</p></li><li class="" data-start="4283" data-end="4343"><p class="" data-start="4285" data-end="4343">若您腸道敏感，切勿空腹服用</p></li></ul><hr class="" data-start="4345" data-end="4348" /><h2 class="" data-start="4350" data-end="4414"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_How_to_Take_Milk_Thistle_for_Best_Results_Pair_It_Smartly"></span>5. 如何服用水飛薊以獲得最佳效果: 巧妙配對<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="4416" data-end="4494">與正確的食物和營養素一起服用時，奶薊草效果最佳.</p><h3 class="" data-start="4496" data-end="4514"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Best_pairings"></span>最佳配對:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ol data-start="4516" data-end="4956"><li class="" data-start="4516" data-end="4669"><p class="" data-start="4519" data-end="4669"><strong data-start="4519" data-end="4535">健康脂肪</strong><br data-start="4535" data-end="4538" />例如. 堅果, 酪梨, 橄欖油<br data-start="4570" data-end="4573" />→ 水飛薊素是脂溶性的－脂肪可以幫助您的身體吸收它, 就像油可以幫助膠水黏得更好.</p></li><li class="" data-start="4671" data-end="4798"><p class="" data-start="4674" data-end="4798"><strong data-start="4674" data-end="4692">維生素C或E</strong><br data-start="4692" data-end="4695" />→ 這些抗氧化劑與水飛薊素一起改善整體細胞保護和肝臟健康.</p></li><li class="" data-start="4800" data-end="4956"><p class="" data-start="4803" data-end="4956"><strong data-start="4803" data-end="4831">益生菌或益生元</strong><br data-start="4831" data-end="4834" />例如. 優格, 發酵食品<br data-start="4865" data-end="4868" />→ 支持腸道健康, 改善營養吸收並減少胃腸道副作用</p></li></ol><h3 class="" data-start="4958" data-end="4977"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Sample_routine"></span>範例程式:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><div class="overflow-x-auto bg-no-repeat contain-inline-size"><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="4979" data-end="5276"><thead data-start="4979" data-end="5008"><tr data-start="4979" data-end="5008"><th data-start="4979" data-end="4986">時間</th><th data-start="4986" data-end="5001">採取什麼措施</th><th data-start="5001" data-end="5008">為什麼</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="5039" data-end="5276"><tr data-start="5039" data-end="5114"><td>晚餐後</td><td>水飛薊 + 一些杏仁</td><td>透過脂肪促進吸收</td></tr><tr data-start="5115" data-end="5197"><td>晚上小吃</td><td>一杯優格</td><td>改善腸道健康, 添加天然益生菌</td></tr><tr data-start="5198" data-end="5276"><td>選修的</td><td>維生素C片劑或柑橘類水果</td><td>增強抗氧化支持</td></tr></tbody></table></div><hr class="" data-start="5278" data-end="5281" /><h2 class="" data-start="5283" data-end="5321"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Final_Verdict_Morning_or_Night"></span>6. 最終判決: 早上或晚上?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><blockquote data-start="5323" data-end="5577"><ul><li data-start="5325" data-end="5577"><strong data-start="5327" data-end="5352">最適合多數人:</strong> 晚餐後, 睡前約30-60分鐘</li><li data-start="5325" data-end="5577"><strong data-start="5404" data-end="5443">避免空腹服用</strong></li><li data-start="5325" data-end="5577"><strong data-start="5451" data-end="5491">搭配健康脂肪和益生菌</strong> 以獲得最佳吸收</li><li data-start="5325" data-end="5577"><strong data-start="5519" data-end="5556">檢查藥物交互作用</strong> 長期使用前</li></ul></blockquote><p class="" data-start="5579" data-end="5605"><strong data-start="5579" data-end="5605">快速記住的提示:</strong></p><blockquote data-start="5607" data-end="5689"><p class="" data-start="5609" data-end="5689">🧾 <em data-start="5612" data-end="5689">「別太早, 不要把它當作乾的——和脂肪一起吃，然後說晚安。 」</em></p></blockquote><hr class="" data-start="5691" data-end="5694" /><h3 class="" data-start="5696" data-end="5713"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="References"></span>參考<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ol data-start="5715" data-end="6237"><li class="" data-start="5715" data-end="5837"><p class="" data-start="5718" data-end="5837">薩勒R, 邁爾R, 布里尼奧利R. 水飛薊素在治療肝臟疾病的用途. <em data-start="5806" data-end="5813">藥品</em>. 2001;61(14):2035–63.</p></li><li class="" data-start="5838" data-end="5970"><p class="" data-start="5841" data-end="5970">弗洛拉·K, 哈恩M, 羅森H, 本納·K. 水飛薊治療肝病. <em data-start="5924" data-end="5944">美國胃腸病學雜誌</em>. 1998 二月;93(2):139–43.</p></li><li class="" data-start="5971" data-end="6103"><p class="" data-start="5974" data-end="6103">梅奧診所. 牛奶薊. <a class="" href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/drugs-supplements-milk-thistle/art-20362874" target="_new" rel="noopener nofollow" data-start="6001" d